The [[Tusk Poker]] is a [[Ranger]] [[weapon]] obtained by combining the [[Shortbow]] and the [[Walrus Tusk]]. It deals the same damage as the [[Shortbow]], but has a chance to gain {{icon/spikes}} on hit, which makes it a strict upgrade, but it does less damage than the other possible [[Shortbow]] upgrades, making this the weakest and most early-game option. The [[Tusk Poker]] can still be useful, as it doesn't take much stamina and there are a number of items which synergize with {{icon/spikes}}.
